  "statement_zh": "雷雨、晚霞、一棵站了很久的树，还有夜里亮起来的海湾。人不在画面里，城市替她们记着天色。",
  "statement_en": "A thunderstorm, an evening sky, a tree that has stood there a long time, and a bay that lights up at night. No one is in these frames. The city keeps the weather for them.",
